cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "RiceBaCI-GEE: Decoupling Cyclone-Induced Saline Inundation from Agronomic Flooding in Sentinel-1/2 Rice Phenology Retrieval"
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the companion OSF pre-registration."
